    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 37 Pearse Road is a cosy three-bedroom semi-detached residence ideally positioned in one of Cork City's most established and sought-after residential locations. Occupying a generous site, the property benefits from substantial side access and offers excellent potential for extension, subject to the necessary planning permissions, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, downsizers, or those seeking to create a larger family home.\r\n\r\nSituated on Pearse Road, the property enjoys a superb location just minutes from Cork City Centre. Ballyphehane is a mature and highly convenient suburb offering an excellent range of local amenities including schools, shops, sporting facilities, cafés and regular public transport services. The area is particularly popular due to its close proximity to the city centre, Cork University Hospital, University College Cork, Cork Airport and the South Link Road network, ensuring easy access to all parts of the city and beyond. \r\n\r\nGround Floor:\r\n\r\nHallway – 1.3m x 1.1m \r\nTiled floor \r\n\r\nLiving Room – 5.0m x 3.3m \r\nTimber flooring, fitted shelving units\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room -5.0m x 4.3m \r\nRange of fitted kitchen units, timber flooring, tiled floor, door to rear, plumbed for washing machine \r\n\r\nFirst Floor:\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 – 4.3m x 3.5m \r\nCarpet floor covering\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 – 3.4m x 2.6m \r\nCarpet floor covering \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 – 2.4m x 2.3m \r\nCarpet floor covering\r\n\r\nBathroom – 2.5m x 1.4m \r\nWC, wash hand basin, bath with shower, tiled floor\r\n\r\nOutside:\r\nRear garden with side access, large garden to front with ample room"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "• Gas fired central heating\r\n• Walking distance of city centre \r\n• Ideal first-time purchase \r\n• BER D2 - BER no. 119187003\r\n• Located directly across from Musgrave Park \r\n• In good condition throughout \r\n•\tSize - 78m2/ 840 sqft\r\n•\tAll walls dry lined"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: D2"
      }
    ],
